    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you but i'm really trying to avoid the er if i can. it's such a hassle and i feel fine otherwise. i don't have any numbness in my arms or legs and i can talk totally normal, so it doesn't really feel like a stroke. if it's just bell's palsy, can't i just wait a day or two to see if it goes away on its own? what would a doctor even do that's different from just watching it?",
